      "rationale": "Earlier uniform reductions failed to preserve click AUC, justifying further allocation diagnostics. Available observations do not identify per-ID or per-field redundancy or frequency support, so do not expand IDs or adopt Zenith tokens. The primary-paper record is link-only; audited benchmark section is limited evidence.",
